{"id":"n74621-1-15","stage":2,"title":"저장 · 储藏","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74621-1-15-1","ko":"그 파일은 나중에 다시 보게 컴퓨터에 저장을 꼭 해 둬.","zh":"那个文件以后还要看，一定要存到电脑里哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"파일은","meaning":"文件","explanation":"파일：文件；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"파일","audio":"/audio/0c8354d0e51a08b2736d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71308","senseId":"2","lemma":"파일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파일은","audio":"/audio/20567dc6bf51efe4a995.mp3"}},{"text":"나중에","meaning":"后来，以后","explanation":"나중：后来，以后；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"나중","audio":"/audio/b8922cba892bea4a603a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62275","senseId":"1","lemma":"나중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나중에","audio":"/audio/a12252500035668f76c9.mp3"}},{"text":"다시","meaning":"再，再次","explanation":"다시：再，再次。","readings":[{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62539","senseId":"1","lemma":"다시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}},{"text":"보게","meaning":"阅读，看","explanation":"보다：阅读，看；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"3","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보게","audio":"/audio/04c22aa1dd122e28419b.mp3"}},{"text":"컴퓨터에","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컴퓨터에","audio":"/audio/05eb1db12f1d67e60f55.mp3"}},{"text":"저장을","meaning":"储藏，保存","explanation":"저장：储藏，保存；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"저장","audio":"/audio/5fb926229090001c0a61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74621","senseId":"1","lemma":"저장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저장을","audio":"/audio/ccb0e9ce3e79af57aa36.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定。","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做、进行（저장을 하다：保存）","explanation":"하다：做、进行（저장을 하다：保存）；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"둬.","meaning":"预先做好并保留结果（-아/어 두다）","explanation":"-아/어 두다：做完某事并保持结果，供后来使用；저장을 해 둬 是嘱咐先保存好文件。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48279","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둬","audio":"/audio/251529517010d35bb1f9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"0c8354d0e51a08b2","term":"파일","zh":"文件","audio":"/audio/0c8354d0e51a08b2736d.mp3","entryId":"71308","definition":"以一定的单位储存在电脑存储器里的信息。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b8922cba892bea4a","term":"나중","zh":"后来，以后","audio":"/audio/b8922cba892bea4a603a.mp3","entryId":"62275","definition":"一定的时间过后。","pronunciation":["나ː중"]},{"id":"920b0d402f08f1fb","term":"다시","zh":"再，再次","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3","entryId":"62539","definition":"反复相同的话或行动。","pronunciation":["다시"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"阅读，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"读书籍、报纸、地图中的字、图、符号等而理解内容。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线快速、准确地处理文件、照片、影像等大量数据的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5fb926229090001c","term":"저장","zh":"储藏，保存","audio":"/audio/5fb926229090001c0a61.mp3","entryId":"74621","definition":"收集保管物品或财物等。","pronunciation":["저ː장"]},{"id":"712da780b7ecf8b7","term":"꼭","zh":"一定，必定","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3","entryId":"48064","definition":"无论有什么事情也务必。","pronunciation":["꼭"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做、进行（저장을 하다：保存）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做、进行（저장을 하다：保存）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"预先做好并保留结果（-아/어 두다）","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"48279","definition":"预先做好并保留结果（-아/어 두다）","pronunciation":["두다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dd01aa9bd322b73b441d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74621-1-15-2","ko":"응, 알았어.","zh":"嗯，知道了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"알았어.","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알았어","audio":"/audio/dede206a3da7cc7d567c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，同意听从。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8c81dda7551620bafeb5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.457,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74621","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":83,"sequenceScore":2.2837,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那个文件以后还要看，一定要存到电脑里哦。","嗯，知道了。","听说敏俊这次考试又得了第一名。真让人羡慕啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那个文件以后还要看，一定要存到电脑里哦。","嗯，知道了。","听说敏俊这次考试又得了第一名。真让人羡慕啊。"],"answer":1}]}
